    "spine": "own",
    "note": "Every change from the Bundesbank's own discount and lombard rate table, 1948-07-01 to 1996-04-19 (held at that level through 1998-12-31, the Bank's last day of independent rate-setting before the ECB took over on 1999-01-01). The lombard rate is carried on each row as secondary. BIS Germany daily matches our discount level on 53 of 60 overlapping change dates and matches our lombard level (the binding rate during the 1979-1980 and 1991 tightening episodes and the 1983-03-18 cut) on 6 more; 1 dates match neither."
